Modification notice (GNU GPL v3, section 5(a)):

  2026-10-07  Forked from Pageless Mobile at commit 1035190
              ("Release 2026-09-08"). Renamed to Audimmory with application ID
              org.audimmory.mobile. Replaced the Pageless server API with the
              Grimmory server API (https://github.com/grimmory-tools/grimmory),
              including token refresh, per-track audio for folder-based
              audiobooks (for example a directory of MP3 files), and mapping of
              Grimmory shelves, magic shelves, bookmarks, progress and reading
